#. Jellyfin stores an ebook position as a fraction of the whole book, not
#. as a page of this file, so it cannot be typed in.
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/dialogs.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%s records your place as an ebook reader position, which no application "
"shows you a number for — so there is nothing meaningful to set by hand. It "
"is still read from the server and shown above."
msgstr ""
"%s registreert je positie in het e-boek, een waarde die geen enkele app "
"weergeeft — je kunt deze dus niet zinvol handmatig instellen. De waarde "
